{"seq":16,"slug":"computer-graphics","title":"计算机图形学","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":17,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics","rating":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 计算机图形学 简介\n\n计算机图形学是研究如何利用计算机生成、处理和显示视觉图像的学科。从游戏引擎中的实时渲染到电影特效中的离线光线追踪，从 CAD 软件中的几何建模到科学可视化中的数据呈现，图形学的应用无处不在。它融合了数学、物理和计算机科学的知识，是最具视觉冲击力的计算机科学分支之一。\n\n本手册面向对图形学感兴趣的软件开发者，特别适合希望理解渲染原理、参与图形引擎开发或从事 GPU 编程的工程师。你需要具备线性代数和基础编程能力，但不需要事先掌握图形学的专业知识。\n\n全书共分为五个章节，建议按照顺序依次学习：\n\n第一章**渲染基础**从图形渲染管线的整体架构出发，介绍光栅化的核心原理和坐标变换体系。这是理解所有图形技术的起点，掌握渲染管线的各个阶段将为后续章节提供必要的全局视角。\n\n第二章**着色与光照**讲解如何模拟光与物体表面的交互来生成逼真的视觉效果。本章涵盖经典的光照模型、可编程着色器的工作原理、纹理映射技术以及基于物理的渲染方法，帮助你理解从简单着色到真实感渲染的完整演进。\n\n第三章**几何处理**聚焦于三维物体的数学表示与空间组织。本章讨论网格表示方法、曲线与曲面的数学模型，以及加速空间查询的数据结构，这些知识对于场景管理和碰撞检测至关重要。\n\n第四章**光线追踪**探讨通过模拟光线传播来生成高质量图像的技术。本章涵盖光线追踪的基本算法、加速结构的设计与实现，以及全局光照的核心方法，展示了与光栅化截然不同的渲染思路。\n\n第五章**GPU 计算**介绍图形处理器的架构特点及其在图形学中的应用。本章涵盖 GPU 架构基础、计算着色器的编程模型、实时渲染优化技术，以及 WebGPU 和 Vulkan 等现代图形 API 的设计理念。\n\n推荐从第一章开始建立对渲染管线的整体认知，然后学习着色与光照掌握视觉效果的核心技术，接着通过几何处理理解场景数据的组织方式。第四章和第五章可以根据兴趣选择性深入，光线追踪偏向离线高质量渲染，GPU 计算偏向实时交互应用。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rendering-fundamentals","title":"渲染基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/rendering-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rendering-pipeline","title":"渲染管线概述","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/rendering-fundamentals/rendering-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rasterization","title":"光栅化","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/rendering-fundamentals/rasterization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"coordinate-transforms","title":"坐标变换","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/rendering-fundamentals/coordinate-transforms"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"shading-and-lighting","title":"着色与光照","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/shading-and-lighting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lighting-models","title":"光照模型","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/shading-and-lighting/lighting-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shaders","title":"着色器编程","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/shading-and-lighting/shaders"},{"seq":3,"slug":"textures","title":"纹理映射","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/shading-and-lighting/textures"},{"seq":4,"slug":"pbr","title":"基于物理的渲染","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/shading-and-lighting/pbr"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"geometry","title":"几何处理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/geometry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mesh-representation","title":"网格表示","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/geometry/mesh-representation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"curves-and-surfaces","title":"曲线与曲面","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/geometry/curves-and-surfaces"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spatial-data-structures","title":"空间数据结构","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/geometry/spatial-data-structures"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ray-tracing","title":"光线追踪","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/ray-tracing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ray-tracing-basics","title":"光线追踪基础","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/ray-tracing/ray-tracing-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"acceleration-structures","title":"加速结构","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/ray-tracing/acceleration-structures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-illumination","title":"全局光照","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/ray-tracing/global-illumination"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"gpu-computing","title":"GPU 计算","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/gpu-computing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gpu-architecture-graphics","title":"GPU 架构与图形处理","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/gpu-computing/gpu-architecture-graphics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compute-shaders","title":"计算着色器","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/gpu-computing/compute-shaders"},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-time-rendering","title":"实时渲染技术","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/gpu-computing/real-time-rendering"},{"seq":4,"slug":"webgpu-and-vulkan","title":"WebGPU 与 Vulkan","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/gpu-computing/webgpu-and-vulkan"}]}]}